      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i feel like i've already tried all that. the \"talking it out\" thing just feels like more work. more noise. it's like people think there's a solution to just... being empty. but there isn't. no matter how much i rest or talk, i just wake up every day feeling like i'm dragging a corpse around. it's just constant, relentless fatigue. i'm just so done with trying to fix something that feels fundamentally broken.",
